  "why": "The theoretical warrant for reading an unfilled 1-cycle as reticulation is the same fact this crate's null rests on: a tree metric leaves no unfilled cycle. What a search of the literature did not find is an independent calibration of that method's SPECIFICITY. This grid supplies the ground truth: three datasets contain reticulation, four do not, and the saturated dataset differs from the baseline only in having ten times the divergence."
